# SKYWELL: the random pit never doubles bats up. Over many seeds, no two
# bats hang closer than two floors apart, and two within four floors of
# each other are at least 80 px apart across, so one position never wakes
# both and one knock can't carry Kip into another. Every pit still has bats.
game skywell
wait 5
press A
cheat seed 37
cheat run
expect bats_crowded == 0
expect foe_0 >= 1
